<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>10</zoom_level><element><id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>0</y><w>2190</w><h>2530</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>title=SD10 — Proposal Approval (UC12, F13)
obj=User~User ACTOR
obj=ProposalView~PV
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=ProposalService~PS
obj=ProposalRepository~PR
obj=Proposal~P
obj=ProposalState~ST
obj=CommandHistory~CH
obj=Command~CMD
obj=Receiver service~RCV

User: Part A - approve a proposal
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV: select a proposal, click Approve
PV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: decideProposal(id, true)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: decide(id, true)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: findById(id)
PR.&gt;PS: Proposal
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: approve(history)
P-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST: approve(proposal, history)
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 PS RCV; PS:       [current state is PendingState]
ST-&gt;&gt;&gt;CH: execute(command)
CH-&gt;&gt;&gt;CMD: execute()
CMD-&gt;&gt;&gt;RCV: apply change (for example BudgetService.setLimit)
combinedFragment=alt~cf2 PS RCV; PS:       [command succeeds]
RCV.&gt;CMD: ok
CMD.&gt;CH: ok
CH.&gt;ST: ok
ST-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: setState(AppliedState)
..=cf2; PS: [command fails]
CMD.&gt;CH: throw CommandFailedException
CH.&gt;ST: exception
ST.&gt;PS: exception (state stays Pending)
--=cf2
..=cf1; PS: [state is Applied, Rejected or Expired]
ST.&gt;PS: throw IllegalStateTransitionException
--=cf1
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: save(proposal)
PS.&gt;F: Proposal or error
F.&gt;PV: Proposal or error message
PV.&gt;User: status shown, affected views refreshed
User: Part B - reject a proposal
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV: select a proposal, click Reject
PV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: decideProposal(id, false)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: decide(id, false)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: findById(id)
PR.&gt;PS: Proposal
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: reject()
P-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST: reject(proposal)
combinedFragment=alt~cf3 PS ST; PS:        [current state is PendingState]
ST-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: setState(RejectedState)
..=cf3; PS: [state is Applied, Rejected or Expired]
ST.&gt;PS: throw IllegalStateTransitionException
--=cf3
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: save(proposal)
PS.&gt;F: Proposal or error
F.&gt;PV: Proposal or error message
PV.&gt;User: status shown
User: Part C - old proposals expire automatically
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV: open the Proposals view
PV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: listPendingProposals()
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: expireOld(month)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: findPending()
PR.&gt;PS: List of Proposal
combinedFragment=loop~cf4 PS ST; PS:            [each pending proposal from an earlier month]
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: expire()
P-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST: expire(proposal)
ST-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: setState(ExpiredState)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: save(proposal)
--=cf4
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: listPending()
PS.&gt;F: List of Proposal
F.&gt;PV: List of Proposal
PV.&gt;User: pending proposals shown</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element></diagram>